<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35001" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνᾰρίθμ-ιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀριθμός</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in the number, making up the number</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλλην ἐνίησι πατὴρ ἐναρίθμιον εἶναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					12.65
				</span></i>
			; <i>counted among</i>, i.e.<i>among</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῴοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					7.86
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποχθονίοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					1.647
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ</span>. <i>among men, in the
				world,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				7.2543.6
			</span></i> (Thebes, <span class="entity">iii/iv A. D.</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δήμου ἐ</span>. f.l. in Epigr. ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				7.27
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρίθμιος</span>.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>taken into account, valued</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔτε ποτ᾽ ἐν πολέμῳ ἐ. οὔτ᾽ ἐνὶ
					βουλῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.202
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐναρίθμια: φίλα, συνήθη</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
